DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Numeric");
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstantFunctions=>0);
Context()->flags->set(reduceConstants=>0);

$fun_2 = Formula("((10/(x)))^2");
$fun_1 = Formula("((x^2+2*x+1)^4)+9");

Context("Interval");

$set_ans_3 = Compute("[0, infinity) U {-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5} U {-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5} U (({-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5}) U [0, infinity) U {-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5})");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("({-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5}) U ({-9, 1, 5, 10} U {-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5}))");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("{-10, -7, -6, 4, 6} U {-10, -7, -6, 4, 6} U {-10, -7, -6, 4, 6}");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("((((4, 9) U {-10, -7, -6, 4, 6}) U {-10, 7}) U (({-10, -7, -6, 4, 6} - ((-infinity, infinity) - (({-10, 7} U ({-10, 7} - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-10, -7, -6, 4, 6}))) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {-10, 7})))))) U {-10, 7} U ((4, 9) U {-10, -7, -6, 4, 6}) U (4, 9) - ((-infinity, infinity) - (((((4, 9)) U ({-10, -7, -6, 4, 6})))))");

Context("Vector");

BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

[`16+9-7-3*14`] is equal to [_____]{-24}
---

What is the value of [`1+12-13*13`]? [_____]{-156}
---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | 4 < x < 9\}`]
- [`B = \{-10, 7\}`]
- [`C = \{-10, -7, -6, 4, 6\}`]

Compute:
- [`C \cup C \cup C = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`(((A \cup C) \cup B) \cup ((C \cap ((B \cup (B \cap C)) \cap B)))) \cup B \cup (A \cup C) \cup A \cap ((((A) \cup (C)))) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{-9, 1, 5, 10\}`]
- [`B = \{x | x \geq 0\}`]
- [`C = \{-9, -8, -6, 1, 4, 5\}`]

Compute:
- [`B \cup C \cup C \cup ((C) \cup B \cup C) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`(C) \cup (A \cup C \cap C) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -10, 5, -4 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle -5, 0, 7 \rangle `]

Compute:
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-5, 0, 7>") x Compute("<-10, 5, -4>")}
- [` \vec{u} \cdot \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-10, 5, -4>") . Compute("<-5, 0, 7>")}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<-5, 0, 7>"))}
- [` \left\| \vec{v} \right\| = `] [_____]{norm(Compute("<-5, 0, 7>"))}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-10, 5, -4>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}

---

Suppose the vectors:
- [` \vec{u} = \langle -3, -10, -7 \rangle `]
- [` \vec{v} = \langle 0, -8, -3 \rangle `]

Compute:
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{Compute("<0, -8, -3>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- Enter a vector parallel to [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-3, -10, -7>")->cmp(parallel=>1)}
- [` \vec{u} \times \vec{v} = `] [_____]{Compute("<-3, -10, -7>") x Compute("<0, -8, -3>")}
- Enter a vector in the same direction as [` \vec{u} `]. [_____]{Compute("<-3, -10, -7>")->cmp(parallel=>1,sameDirection=>1)}
- [` \vec{v} \times \vec{u} = `] [_____]{Compute("<0, -8, -3>") x Compute("<-3, -10, -7>")}
- Enter a unit vector in the direction of [` \vec{v} `]. [_____]{unit(Compute("<0, -8, -3>"))}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_1]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()}
- [`f''(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_1->D()->D()}

---

Given this function:

>> [`[$fun_2]`] <<

Compute:
- [`f'(x) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()}
- [`f'(0) =`] [_____]{$fun_2->D()->eval(x=>0)}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
